{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1478235-changeling-the-dreaming-c20-questions-about-online-magic-interactions","id":1478235,"title":"Changeling The Dreaming (C20) Questions about Online Magic Interactions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-07T13:51:07-07:00","id":1478235,"title":"Changeling The Dreaming (C20) Questions about Online Magic Interactions","content":"I have questions about how Changelings magically interact with the internet and the like. For example in the text about House Eiluned, it talks about a society called &quot;Knights of the Silver Web&quot; and says that they maintain their own mystical version of cloud storage. I imagine this storage must be protected by magic as it must contain a lot of mystical and confidential information.<br /> <br /> These days I saw in the Boggan's Kithbook, that apparently they have a gossip app called &quot;Honeycombr&quot; that is only visible to enchanted eyes.<br /> How are these things possible? I looked for arts and realms that could cover this aspect and didn't find anything specific.<br /> <br /> Of course, there doesn't need to be a specific Art for the internet, but a means to direct Art across one (or more) Realms. I searched the realms but also didn't find any that fit what I was looking for. Level 5 &quot;Prop&quot; &quot;Arcane Artifact&quot; appears to apply arts only to &quot;complex objects&quot;. Would it be possible to direct Arts to blogs, websites and the like? How could it have been possible to create a gossip app visible only to enchanted eyes? How would House Eiluned have created a mystical storage cloud or magically protected a storage cloud?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25762-yuesidhe","name":"YueSidhe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}